      "en": "Dr. S. R. Ranganathan formulated the Chain Procedure in 1938 in his seminal book 'Theory of Library Catalogue'. It is a mechanical method used to derive Subject Headings / Class Index Entries (CIE) systematically from the digits of a book's class number in CCC."
