      "en": "According to Dr. S. R. Ranganathan, a document's Call Number consists of three distinct elements: Call Number = Class Number (subject class) + Book Number (distinguishes titles within the same class) + Collection Number (indicates physical sequence or special location, e.g. Reference/Rare)."
