      "en": "Dr. Ranganathan's Book Number formula is [L F Y A V S C Cr], where L = Language of book, F = Form of exposition, Y = Year of publication (converted to chronological notation), A = Accession part, V = Volume, S = Supplement, C = Copy number, and Cr = Criticism number."
