      "en": "Fees assessed for delinquent returns are designated as 'Overdue Charges'. The primary intent is deterrence and prompt document return rather than revenue. Dr. S. R. Ranganathan advocated placing a 'Conscience Box' at the entrance, encouraging voluntary anonymous fee deposit to respect reader dignity."
