      "en": "According to GFR 2017 guidelines: Libraries with up to 20,000 volumes undergo annual physical verification. Libraries housing 20,000 to 50,000 volumes must be verified at least once every three years. Libraries with over 50,000 volumes perform continuous sample verification across a 5-year cycle."
