      "en": "Weeded books are public property and require due process: a survey list is submitted to the Library Committee / Executive Board. Following their formal resolution of condemnation, items are stamped 'Withdrawn / Written-off', the resolution number is noted in the Accession Register, and items are disposed of via public pulp auction."
