      "en": "The four procedural steps of ZBB are: 1. Identification of decision units, 2. Formulation of decision packages (delineating costs, alternative courses, and consequences of non-funding), 3. Hierarchical Ranking of decision packages via cost-benefit evaluation, and 4. Fund allocation down to the financial cutoff line."
