      "en": "Formula Budgeting calculates financial requirements mechanically through pre-established mathematical formulas and norms (e.g. Ranganathan's Per Capita method, or Kothari Commission's ₹25/student + ₹300/faculty allocation). It ensures mathematical objectivity and equitable funding across educational institutions."
