      "en": "A Thymol Fumigation Chamber is the standard fungicidal treatment for mold-infested library collections. Crystals of thymol are vaporized using gentle heat from a 40-watt electric bulb inside an airtight enclosure, effectively eradicating fungal hyphae and spores without weakening paper fibers."
