      "en": "The CPU (Central Processing Unit) structurally comprises three primary engines: 1. Arithmetic Logic Unit (ALU) for mathematical computation and logical comparison, 2. Control Unit (CU) orchestrating instruction fetching, decoding, and data bus management, and 3. Registers (high-speed internal temporary storage cells)."
