      "en": "1D barcodes store data in one dimension, holding approximately 20–25 characters. 2D QR codes store data across both vertical and horizontal matrices, accommodating up to 7,089 numeric or 4,296 alphanumeric characters with built-in Reed-Solomon error correction allowing readability even if 30% mutilated."
