      "en": "During the 1st All India Library Conference held at the Asiatic Society, Calcutta (12-14 September 1933), the Indian Library Association (ILA) was founded on 13 September 1933. Dr. M.O. Thomas was elected as its first President and Khan Bahadur K.M. Asadullah (Librarian of Imperial Library) was elected as its first Secretary."
