      "en": "In 1949, Dr. S.R. Ranganathan initiated and edited 'ABGILA' (Annals, Bulletin and Granthalaya of the Indian Library Association) as ILA's official organ. It was structured in three parts: Annals (advanced research papers), Bulletin (association activities), and Granthalaya (articles in Hindi and regional languages)."
