      "en": "The State Library Planning Committee (SLPC) is the apex state-level advisory body constituted by state governments. Chaired typically by the State Education/Culture Secretary or Director of Public Libraries, the SLPC screens local library applications and submits certified recommendations to RRRLF for grant disbursement."
