      "en": "W.C. Berwick Sayers is celebrated as the 'First Grammarian of Classification'. He systematically codified principles of classification into formal Canons in his seminal treatises 'Canons of Classification' (1915) and 'Manual of Classification' (1926). He was also the teacher and mentor of Dr. S.R. Ranganathan at University College London."
