      "en": "Ranganathan's complete Book Number Formula is [L] [F] [Y] [A] . [v] - [S] ; [C] : [g] [e] [d]. In this formula, [L] indicates the Language of the book, while a dot followed by [v] indicates the specific Volume number of a multi-volume work."
