    "question": {
      "hi": "जोसेफ पी. सेगल (Joseph P. Segal) द्वारा विकसित 'CREW' विडिंग पद्धति के 'MUSTIE' संक्षिप्त नाम में अक्षर 'U' किसका प्रतीक है?",
      "en": "In the widely adopted 'CREW' weeding methodology developed by Joseph P. Segal, what does the letter 'U' represent in the evaluation acronym 'MUSTIE'?"
    },
    "options": {
      "A": {
        "hi": "अपठनीय भाषा (Unreadable language)",
        "en": "Unreadable language"
      },
      "B": {
        "hi": "अद्वितीय (Unique)",
        "en": "Unique"
      },
      "C": {
        "hi": "असमर्थनीय / जर्जर व फटी-पुरानी भौतिक स्थिति (Ugly - physical condition beyond repair)",
        "en": "Ugly (deteriorated, torn, or worn-out physical condition beyond mending)"
      },
      "D": {
        "hi": "उपयोगी (Useful)",
        "en": "Useful"
      }
    },
    "correctAnswer": "C",
    "explanation": {
      "hi": "CREW विधि में MUSTIE के 6 मानदंड हैं: M = Misleading (भ्रामक/गलत तथ्य), U = Ugly (जर्जर/गंदी/फटी हुई पुस्तक), S = Superseded (नया संस्करण आ गया हो), T = Trivial (तुच्छ/अनावश्यक सामग्री), I = Irrelevant (संस्थान के लिए अप्रासंगिक), E = Elsewhere available (अन्यत्र सुलभ)।",
      "en": "In Joseph P. Segal's MUSTIE weeding formula: M = Misleading, U = Ugly (worn out, dirty, badly damaged), S = Superseded (replaced by a newer edition), T = Trivial, I = Irrelevant, E = Elsewhere easily available."
    },
